<zk>
	<label multiline="true">
		The Today button of the daterange popup is drawn only when showTodayLink is on, so a
		showTodayLink flip that the popup could not act on must not make the next bind demand the
		-today node.
		1. Click the calendar button. The popup opens without a Today button.
		2. Click "today on". The Today button shows up and there is no error box.
	</label>

	<daterangebox id="drb" format="yyyy-MM-dd" width="360px"/>
	<button id="todayOn" label="today on" onClick="drb.setShowTodayLink(true)"/>
</zk>
